servers\n- Default behavior\n\n## Commands\n\n### List Servers\n\n```\n/mcp 
list\n```\n\nShows configured servers and their connection status.\n\n### Server
Status\n\n```\n/mcp status\n```\n\nShows detailed status including available 
tools.\n\n### Logging Control\n\n```\n/mcp logging on     # Enable MCP logging 
messages\n/mcp logging off    # Disable MCP logging messages  \n/mcp logging 
status # Show current logging status\n```\n\nControls visibility of MCP server 
log messages.\n\n## Available MCP Servers\n\n### Official Anthropic Servers\n\n|
